stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9198797345161438,"text_excerpt":"My wife and I attended a wedding here. This place is beautiful with such an historic feel. If your ever able to attend a wedding here don't miss it. The food was excellent, we had about 15 different dishes offered to us and all that we tasted were great."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
